    "The podcasts you purchase in Apple Podcasts Subscriptions are associated with your Apple ID. Your device trust score is used to prevent fraud. Data on your podcast listening and interactions is also used to improve and personalize the service and is not associated with your Apple ID. See how your data is managed..." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Podcasts, die du über Apple Podcasts Abos kaufst, sind mit deiner Apple-ID verknüpft. Dein Gerätevertrauensscore hilft, Betrug zu verhindern. Daten zu deinem Podcast-Hörverhalten und deinen Interaktionen werden außerdem genutzt, um den Service zu verbessern und zu personalisieren – sie sind aber nicht mit deiner Apple-ID verknüpft. Schau dir an, wie deine Daten verwaltet werden..."
          }
        },
        "el" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Τα podcasts που αγοράζεις στις Συνδρομές Apple Podcasts συνδέονται με το Apple ID σου. Το trust score της συσκευής σου χρησιμοποιείται για την αποτροπή απάτης. Τα δεδομένα για την ακρόαση και τις αλληλεπιδράσεις σου χρησιμοποιούνται επίσης για να βελτιώσουν και να εξατομικεύσουν την υπηρεσία, χωρίς να συνδέονται με το Apple ID σου. Δες πώς διαχειριζόμαστε τα δεδομένα σου..."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The podcasts you purchase in Apple Podcasts Subscriptions are associated with your Apple ID. Your device trust score is used to prevent fraud. Data on your podcast listening and interactions is also used to improve and personalize the service and is not associated with your Apple ID. See how your data is managed..."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los podcasts que compras en Apple Podcasts Subscriptions están asociados a tu Apple ID. Tu puntaje de confianza del dispositivo se usa para evitar fraudes. También se usa la información sobre tu escucha e interacciones para mejorar y personalizar el servicio, pero no se asocia a tu Apple ID. Mira cómo se gestiona tu información..."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I podcast che acquisti con Apple Podcasts Subscriptions sono associati al tuo ID Apple. Il punteggio di affidabilità del tuo dispositivo viene usato per prevenire le frodi. I dati sul tuo ascolto e sulle tue interazioni con i podcast vengono usati anche per migliorare e personalizzare il servizio e non sono associati al tuo ID Apple. Scopri come gestiamo i tuoi dati..."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Podcastsのサブスクリプションで購入したポッドキャストは、あなたのApple IDに紐づいてるよ。デバイスの信頼スコアは不正防止に使われるし、ポッドキャストの視聴や操作データもサービス向上やパーソナライズのために使われるけど、Apple IDとは関連付けられないよ。データの管理方法はこちら..."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Podcasts 구독에서 구매한 팟캐스트는 Apple ID에 연결돼요. 기기 신뢰 점수는 사기 방지를 위해 사용돼요. 팟캐스트 청취 및 상호작용 데이터는 서비스 개선과 개인화에 쓰이지만 Apple ID와는 연결되지 않아요. 데이터 관리 방법 자세히 보기..."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "พอดแคสต์ที่คุณซื้อใน Apple Podcasts Subscriptions จะเชื่อมกับ Apple ID ของคุณ คะแนนความน่าเชื่อถือของอุปกรณ์จะถูกใช้เพื่อป้องกันการโกง ข้อมูลการฟังและการใช้งานของคุณจะถูกนำไปปรับปรุงบริการให้เหมาะกับคุณมากขึ้น และจะไม่เชื่อมกับ Apple ID ของคุณนะ ดูรายละเอียดเกี่ยวกับการจัดการข้อมูลของคุณ..."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Các podcast bạn mua trong Apple Podcasts Subscriptions sẽ liên kết với Apple ID của bạn. Điểm tin cậy thiết bị của bạn được dùng để ngăn chặn gian lận. Dữ liệu về việc nghe podcast và tương tác của bạn cũng được dùng để cải thiện và cá nhân hóa dịch vụ, và không liên kết với Apple ID của bạn. Xem cách dữ liệu của bạn được quản lý..."
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你喺 Apple Podcasts 訂閱買嘅 podcast 會同你嘅 Apple ID 連結。你部裝置嘅信任分數會用嚟防止詐騙。我哋亦會用你聽 podcast 同互動嘅數據去改善同個人化服務，但唔會同你嘅 Apple ID 連結。了解你嘅數據點樣被管理..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
